  "name": "Sneak-Peek Tins",
  "category": "product_promotion",
  "description": {
    "text": "Tins of March 2011 that brought the first Unova Pokémon to the English card game a month before the Black & White set. Each held a holofoil Snivy BW01, Tepig BW02 or Oshawott BW03, the first Black & White promos, with a figure of the same Pokémon, four older booster packs and a preview pack of five cards from the coming set. Ken Sugimori's drawings first came in Japan in September 2010 in the Journey Partners collection; the English cards put them on new backgrounds.",
